---
title: Topics | Vermont Football Officials
description: The Information articles grouped by topic — getting started, rules, mechanics, crew cards, position cards, game management and printables.
layout: layouts/main.pug
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

h1 Topics
p.lead Every Information article, grouped by what it's about.

- var count = function(name) { return (collections.information || []).filter(function (item) { return (item.data.tags || []).indexOf(name) !== -1; }).length; }

div.list-group
  each topic in (topics || [])
    a.list-group-item.list-group-item-action(href='/tags/' + topic.slug + '/')
      .row
        .col
          div= topic.name
          small.text-secondary= topic.description
        .col-auto.text-secondary.text-nowrap
          - var n = count(topic.name)
          | #{n} #{n === 1 ? 'article' : 'articles'}

p.mt-4
  a(href='/information/') See every article
